{"meta":{"id":"context-path","category":"it/syntax/jsp/setup","title":"프로젝트 경로 (ctp) · JSP","subtitle":"(JSP · JSTL · EL)","summary":"${pageContext.request.contextPath} 를 c:set 으로 ctp 변수에, request.getContextPath, IPv4 설정","tags":["jsp","f-navigation"],"color":"teal","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-teal","source":"언어별사용 정리.xlsx","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-teal-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-teal-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-teal-50 text-teal-700 border border-teal-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></span>JSP · JSTL · EL</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">프로젝트 경로 (ctp) · JSP</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-teal-50/70 border border-teal-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-teal-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> ${pageContext.request.contextPath} 를 c:set 으로 ctp 변수에, request.getContextPath, IPv4 설정</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">프로젝트 시작 경로 (contextPath)</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">jsp</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">&lt;%-- 1. JSTL 변수로 만들어 두고 사용 (권장) --%&gt;\r\n&lt;c:set var=&quot;ctp&quot; value=&quot;${pageContext.request.contextPath}&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;a href=&quot;${ctp}/member/login&quot;&gt;로그인&lt;/a&gt;\r\n&lt;link rel=&quot;stylesheet&quot; href=&quot;${ctp}/resources/css/style.css&quot;&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;%-- 2. java 표현식 --%&gt;\r\n&lt;%=request.getContextPath()%&gt;       &lt;!-- &quot;/프로젝트명&quot; --&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;%-- 현재 시간 넣기 --%&gt;\r\n&lt;input type=&quot;hidden&quot; name=&quot;wDate&quot; value=&quot;&lt;%=new java.util.Date() %&gt;&quot; /&gt;</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">주소를 /member/login 처럼 쓰면 프로젝트명이 빠진다 — 앞에 ${ctp} 를 붙인다</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">참고 — 서버 IPv4 설정</h2></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">톰캣 실행 VM 인자에 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>-Djava.net.preferIPv4Stack=true</code> 추가 (엔터 없이 한 칸 띄워서 등록) — request.getRemoteAddr() 가 IPv6(0:0:0:0:0:0:0:1) 대신 IPv4 로 나옴</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/jsp/setup/context-path","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"jsp","title":"JSP · JSTL · EL","path":"it/syntax/jsp"},{"id":"setup","title":"기본 연결","path":"it/syntax/jsp/setup"}],"hasImage":false}